  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.2 - Browser.Offscreen (Chrome chrome.offscreen: CreateDocument / CloseDocument / HasDocument). ExtensionPortService: a content script gets a MessagePort to the extension background (transferables: ImageBitmap, ArrayBuffer, VideoFrame), handed over with a single-use token through the library bridge page. Verified on Chrome (content script - service worker - offscreen document); the Firefox path (background page) is written but not yet verified. On SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.2.",
